DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261015T211500
UID:f8e03ddfa2e1b2b7df219a68@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of meditation\, discussion and Dharma t
 eaching. The second half of the class features a conversation about how we
  can relate themes from the Buddhas teachings to our lives today.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/thurs-night-15-oct
END:VEVENT
